<title>BELARUS: TABLE-Belarus Jan-May trade gap wider at $874.7mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belarus Jan-May trade gap wider at $874.7mln.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus posted a trade deficit of $874.7 million in the first five months of this year after a $658.3 million gap in the same period of 1996, the Statistics Ministry said.</p>
<p>BELARUS MERCHANDISE TRADE</p>
<p>    (million dollars)		   Jan-May 97   Jan-May 96</p>
<p>    Exports			2,352.4	2,193.6</p>
<p>    Imports			3,227.1	2,851.9</p>
<p>    Trade balance		-874.7	 -658.3</p>
<p>--Minsk newsroom +375 017-227 3594</p>
</text>
